{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open the club.<br>Monitors hum. Lights flicker. The elevator keeps running.<br>Clients come and go. You take payments. You turn on the machines. You keep things quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes something else arrives.<br>Sometimes you wish it didn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You feel tired. Hungry. Unsteady.<br>But the work must continue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep it running.<br>Keep it clean.<br><br>FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a place that feels familiar, yet deeply wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor your hunger, thirst, sanity, and exhaustion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome guests. Handle problems. Survive the shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX-inspired visuals, VHS noise, distorted ambience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow descent into isolation and routine.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826840?t=1762685206","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826840/e40dde575328bf3b72f4b53464f26146a2a8d6eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762685206","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826840/69ebee415d43f86b8db06738dcdb69386adba774/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762685206","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826840/69ebee415d43f86b8db06738dcdb69386adba774/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762685206","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open the club.<br>Monitors hum. Lights flicker. The elevator keeps running.<br>Clients come and go. You take payments. You tur